## 🛠️ Setup & Deployment Guide

Follow these steps to run the Alexa-integrated Bus Tracker locally and connect it with the Alexa Developer Console for testing:

---

### 1. ✅ Prerequisites

Before you begin, ensure the following tools are installed:

- **Python 3.7+**
- **Flask**
- **Ngrok** – for exposing your local Flask server to the internet
- **Alexa Developer Account** – [developer.amazon.com](https://developer.amazon.com)
- **CTA Bus Tracker API Key** – [https://www.transitchicago.com/developers/bustracker/](https://www.transitchicago.com/developers/bustracker/)
- **Visual Studio Code** (or any IDE)

---

